    <guid isPermaLink="false">6861e409bef90978ec899aaa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 01:12:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次嘉宾是张恬，之前是电商平台大健康品类的负责人，也是我们</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b84dtVEXiC9ugoEWFqxhdA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b84dtVEXiC9ugoEWFqxhdA"><span>狮途会</span></a><span>的会员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们当面聊过几次大健康的打法，是非常有实操经验的朋友，这次专门在我们公司在线下录了这期播客，希望有用。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> &nbsp;如何定义大健康行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> &nbsp;大健康行业现状与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> &nbsp;企业在线上营销中面临的两大问题：缺乏自然流量以及如何有效利用商业流量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> &nbsp;功效产品的种草策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> &nbsp;益生菌类产品的市场策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">30:54</a> 商业市场中的创新与模仿策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2371">39:31</a> &nbsp;企业私域运营的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> &nbsp;大健康电商内容生产和推广困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3631">60:31</a> &nbsp;大健康未来的市场机会</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>韩叙</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>张恬，现【确实有用】公司创始人，专注药企/功能性食品电商全链路赋能。已帮助800+商家实现业绩增长。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>编辑：</span></strong><span>汪真</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Overthinking—Acid&nbsp;Ghost</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Pokemon&nbsp;In&nbsp;NYC—Andrew&nbsp;Applepie</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/视频号/微博/即刻：韩叙HanXu</span></p>]]></description>
