    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Jun 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恢复更新！这次是做客我们狮途会的会员：zoey的播客（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64def01e82382ef927d7cb5f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64def01e82382ef927d7cb5f"><span>在场营销人</span></a><span>）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>围绕【高客单成交】这个事在聊，也是我们最近打磨出来的方法论，以及一些跑出来的案例。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也不敢说是给大家上课，就是感受层面的吧，夹杂着一些干货。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你们喜欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">00:04:47</a> 为选什么选择服务高客单非标品的企业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">00:08:58</a> 从热点聊起，为啥农夫山泉创始人钟琰琰不认同老板做直播带货？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">00:11:37</a> &nbsp;为什么企业需要做IP？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">00:17:30</a> 传统企业的新媒体焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">00:23:07</a> 电机行业案例：靠短视频获得价值百万客户线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">00:30:17</a> 警惕割韭菜的服务商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">00:35:35</a> 观点碰撞：做爆款有没有用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">00:44:00</a> 反常识认知：做IP过程中最重要的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">00:49:45</a> 合理预期：流量只是手段，最终要回归生意本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">00:56:58</a> 咨询行业真相：为什么拒绝比稿？信任是高客单成交的唯一货币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3802">01:03:22</a> 韩叙创业碎碎念：十年坚持输出，坚信长期主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4023">01:07:03</a> 内容获客，最先启动的动作是？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>zoey的介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>朱印Zoey.Z，</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b84dtVEXiC9ugoEWFqxhdA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b84dtVEXiC9ugoEWFqxhdA"><span>狮途会会员</span></a><span>，社交媒体生态观察者，懂品牌痛点的策略型操盘手，内容营销机构「擦想走火」创始人，帮助80+客户拿到生意结果。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在这里找到我：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/视频号/微博/即刻：韩叙HanXu</span></p>]]></description>
