  <item>
    <title>57.从获客到交付，做好B端业务的4个要点·对谈沈云</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6747d5378d1233fb0daa31f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6747d5378d1233fb0daa31f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2024 02:59:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>C端红利没了，最近两年关注B端业务的越来越多，包括我们自己也是，但市面上聊这个事的专家还是不多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次请老朋友沈云来聊聊这事，他讲的不是互联网打法，而是有更多销售或商务视角，用他的话说：这叫怎么搞定客户。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> &nbsp;ToB如何获客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> &nbsp;订单跟进是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> &nbsp;如何处理多角色决策&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> &nbsp;沟通是项目交付的重要环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> &nbsp;如何做续签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2517">41:57</a> &nbsp;超级个体如何做ToB业务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> &nbsp;快速与客户建立信任关系的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>韩叙，可能有戏创始人&amp;CEO，企业增长顾问</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>沈云，Hi-Finance市场总监</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>编辑：</span></strong><span>汪真</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/视频号/微博/即刻：韩叙HanXu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们建了听友群，但不会做啥运营措施，单纯只是搭建一个沟通的桥梁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感兴趣的朋友，可以关注公众号「韩叙HanXu」，回复数字9，即可获得进群二维码。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Dog Days Are Over—Florence + The Machine</span></p><span></span><p><span>片中：From The Start—Laufey</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：THOUGHT YOU WERE THE ONE—Tommy Richman</span></p>]]></description>
