  <item>
    <title>55.零售行业怎么做私域，从搭建私域体系的3个关键点聊起·对谈马凌玲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67329a38f373fe5d4d874b43</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67329a38f373fe5d4d874b43</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2024 00:16:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>私域这个话题，从没过时。但在播客上不太好聊，因为并不是理念或趋势这种务虚的话题，而是非常流程化很拼执行的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期内容有点像课程，信息密度高，有点干，先预警一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对谈嘉宾是马凌玲，她以前在字节做过私域的负责人，现在是咨询公司的咨询师，服务过小罐茶、平安银行、宁波银行等客户，甲乙方的资源都有，实操经验超强。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从私域视角，如何看待零售行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;私域的三个核心环节：拉新、首购、复购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;电商型私域常见的拉新玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;包裹卡玩法的ROI测算逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;黄金珠宝行业怎么做私域成交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;餐饮行业拉新的核心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;电商型私域如何让用户产生首购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;门店型私域常见的首购玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;复购体系：日常复购、活动复购、会员复购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3648">60:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;做私域要避开哪些坑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>韩叙，可能有戏创始人&amp;CEO，企业增长顾问</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>马凌玲，造物者咨询合伙人，前字节杭州私域运营负责人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>编辑：</span></strong><span>汪真</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Deep in the rose—结冰水</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Chocolate Lullaby—Asbo/Soulspeak</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号/视频号/即刻：韩叙HanXu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们建了听友群，但不会做啥运营措施，单纯只是搭建一个沟通的桥梁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感兴趣的朋友，可以关注公众号「韩叙HanXu」，回复数字9，即可获得进群二维码。</span></p>]]></description>
